  </div>
  <div class="ab-notes"><h4>Facilitator</h4><ul>
    <li>Do not press for a choice in a group setting. Name both paths, then stop talking.</li>
    <li>The most powerful close is the last line on the next slide. Read it and let the silence hold.</li>
