  <div class="ab-eyebrow"><span class="ab-num">Close</span></div>
  <h2>What you take with you</h2>
  <p>You came in somewhere on the map. You have now seen your own position argued at its strongest, and the two you do not hold argued the same way. You have seen a framework reach its ceiling, and a word offered for the honest space between claiming everything and claiming nothing.</p>
  <p>None of that requires you to change. It only asks that whatever you hold, you hold it knowingly — and that you not mistake the edge of one faculty for the edge of what is real.</p>
  <blockquote style="font-size:1.2rem">"Come now, and let us reason together, saith the Lord."<cite>{% scripture "Isaiah 1:18" %}</cite></blockquote>
  <p class="ab-lede">You are welcome here whatever you decide. That was true before you started and it is true now.</p>
